<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi forces and the pro-Iran militia Kataib Hezbollah have agreed on a compromise that creates a joint security command in Jurf al-Nasr and Jurf al-Sakhar, while Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has ordered a new security command for the area. Security officials arrested the oil pipeline chief on smuggling allegations and placed forces on alert as the Jurf al-Sakhar command prepares to start operations. French nationals were sentenced to life imprisonment for joining ISIL, and French ISIS propagandists are standing trial in Iraq. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQSERzb0VJOVctVVAxTkhQUHVKYWJJcFJEUTIxMUZGV0hIOHFMNTM0Y0RvWi1ETmh6MDVYS2xIaFNTV0lYU2h6dUwwVkZ0THFaNVl6cDItcXNHTWlwSDFmRmxKTzNPblllZnA5SjVMbFFqMHNDYVBNUUU5aEtXdU52WFRJaHRJb0s0TGFMYWpvVTFEalc3cnNHelJtX05zR2hrdFY1NVBPYjNUUnZNTTQ3Mmt1NnBvSk5YOS15YVgyVUwxMTNt?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOdUZQaUpGZ3l4akMxeDR1Q0ZuX2NGbmV4S0tMZkpKZGc2UTZGcjZuZ0gwQ3loclJDc2pKc1NMTUJlamlFTmtSY1kzYVFUXzJTbFpJMFFxV05ua3ltRU94VGJCc1QzLTViNXIyZmtJYXhvbF8xaGxEZGM4czJpWHVkOFlqV2syckRCOEpEQlVKRnotcXR0M2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
